    "notes": [
      "Applies persistent damage for the tether, and persistent area damage additionally tagged as indirect to enemies within the Null Zone.",
      "Spell shield prevents both the tether and the Null Zone from appearing, however Malzahar will continue to channel. [https://www.reddit.com/r/Sivir/comments/g7yt38/if_you_shield_malzahar_ult_he_ironically_gets_ccd/]",
      "The tether will not break if the target enters a zombie state or enters resurrection.",
      "As long as the target is within the tether radius, they will take the full tether damage over 2.5 seconds even if they are not tethered due to the tether being broken early into the channel.\n  - This occurs regardless of how the tether was broken.\n  - If the target exits tether range they will stop taking damage, but can be damaged again by the remaining ticks if they re-enter the tether range within the duration.",
      "Removing the suppression will also remove the reveal.",
      "Malzahar places himself onto the ground and interrupts displacements affecting him upon starting the channel.",
      "If a target is currently being affected by Malefic Visions, casting Nether Grasp on them will grant 2 stacks toward effects such as Electrocute.\n  - This is, correctly, not the case if Nether Grasp is cast before Malefic Visions.",
      "The following table refers for interactions while Malzahar is channeling:\n  - The channel will be interrupted if the tether is broken."
